   "en": "Written question: how many Brussels households and businesses located in a flood hazard zone are actually protected by the works completed since 2020 (stormwater basins, rain-network structures), what percentage reduction in risk does that represent, and will the Government publish a quantified review every year on the model of Copenhagen's?"
